<title>POLAND: Polish Viscoplast to start bourse trade on May 20.</title>
<headline>Polish Viscoplast to start bourse trade on May 20.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish chemical company Viscoplast SA will start bourse trade on the parallel market on May 20, the bourse's president Wieslaw Rozlucki told reporters.</p>
<p>The company's 900,000-share initial public offering in late January and early February priced at 14 zlotys per share was heavily oversubscribed.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
